<title>JAPAN: Shares of Yaohan, Aoki bid-only in morning trade.</title>
<headline>Shares of Yaohan, Aoki bid-only in morning trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Yaohan Japan Corp and Aoki Corp were bid-only on Monday morning on interest in technical buying after the shares had slipped sharply in the past week due to concerns over the firms' financial health, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0045 GMT, shares of retailer Yaohan were bid-only at 105 yen against Friday's 95 yen. Aoki shares were also bid-only at 94 yen, compared with Friday's 84 yen finish.</p>
